Implement auto-calling orchestrator that fetches leads from Google
Sheets, executes calls sequentially, analyzes transcripts via OpenAI,
records results back to the sheet, and sends follow-up emails.

Features:
- Lead management with status tracking (pending/completed/retry limit)
- Business hours enforcement (9:00-17:30 JST, lunch break excluded)
- Auto-retry on no-answer (max 3 times)
- Start/pause/resume/stop controls via REST API
- Phone number normalization for Google Sheets formats
- SKIP_BUSINESS_HOURS_CHECK env var for testing

Includes unit tests (lead, state machine, business hours, orchestrator,
sheets repository) and integration tests (API endpoints).

Refs #4

