feat(dashboard): add web dashboard with KPIs, lead management, and live status

Implement browser-based dashboard at /dashboard with:
- KPI cards: total leads, calls, success rate, avg interest, pending, retry limit
- Lead list with status filter tabs (all/pending/completed/retry limit)
- Call history timeline sorted by most recent
- Live orchestrator status with start/pause/resume/stop controls
- Add new lead form with validation
- Google Sheets direct link

Backend: dashboard API endpoints (GET kpis/leads/call-history/status, POST leads)
Frontend: static HTML + Tailwind CSS CDN + vanilla JS

Includes unit tests (DashboardUseCase), integration tests (API endpoints),
and E2E tests (Playwright - 10 scenarios covering all dashboard features).

Refs #4

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
